title: Party Unity
subtitle: Manage the party's quarrels.
card-image: img/cards/party_disunity.svg
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_disunity_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4

The party has always been a party of tendencies, and the tendencies do not like one another. Whom will you spend the time to reassure? (Internal dissent: [+ d_dissent : dissent +].)

- @intl: [+ flabel_intl +].
- @defencist: [+ flabel_defencist +].
- @rightdef: [+ flabel_rightdef +].
- @unions: [+ flabel_unions +].
- @bund: [+ flabel_bund +].
- @all: A party conference for everyone.
- @easy_discard

@intl
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -10);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 2);
!}

A column in the paper and a place on the executive committee have been found for [+ ilbl +]. They are, for a time, content.

@defencist
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, -8);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 2);
!}

[+ Dlbl +] have been reassured that the line will not change. The left wing is suspicious.

@rightdef
view-if: rightdef_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, -10);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 3);
!}

[+ Rlbl +] were flattered with an invitation to write the editorial. They will not stay flattered long.

@unions
view-if: unions_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, -8);
!}

[+ flabel_unions +] want to be consulted on every important decision, and have been promised that they will be.

@bund
view-if: bund_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 0, -8);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 1);
!}

[+ flabel_bund +] are a current with its own press, its own members and its own memory. They have been promised a voice in the committee.

@all
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A conference costs a resource.
on-arrival: {!
RO.pay(Q, 1);
for (var f of Q.factions) { RO.fac(Q, f, 0, -4); }
!}

A conference allowed everyone to speak, and everyone did. It ran four days. Tempers are lower.
